{"server":"tw","storyId":"act34side_level_act34side_07_beg","groupId":"act34side","stageId":"act34side_07","title":"從歷史中來","storyCode":"BP-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act34side/level_act34side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"bb39d5ad7848fb17b74c33449c9d534671a078ff0a7c352e04ce16ac30f972a4","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"海嗣侵入信標塔，城市異變陡生。克萊門莎執政官組織全城應對災變，護送博士與凱爾希去往港口，卻在途中遭遇了未曾設想的敵人——已經海嗣化的阿戈爾人，數百年前失蹤的先史文明研究者。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"總有鈴鐺般的樂聲從穹頂上傳來，那是無數須腕狀的生物監測系統在解析海流最微小的動向。\n港口處時而傳來隱隱的鈍響，出港或是返航的艦船如同龐大的鱗，優雅地破開萬鈞海水。\n壓縮態的物資順著半空中的光纜進入千家萬戶，它們流淌時傳出細微的嗡鳴。\n……\n萬千聲響，繁多而不雜亂，居住在彌利亞留姆的十餘萬軍民，早已熟悉這座孤城的聲音。\n但所有人都在此刻停了下來，懷疑起自己的耳朵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g1_beaconsquare"},{"type":"narration","text":"起初，彷彿只是一縷風掠過礁石的夾角。\n繼而，一隻幼小的生命從母胎的溫暖中探出腦袋。\n緊接著，是一個群體、一個巢穴、一片海域。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g1_beaconsquare"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g2_beaconsquare_nest"},{"type":"narration","text":"……生命集中綻放的異響，清晰可聞。\n海的子嗣反哺海洋。\n它吻過文明，於是文明變得更加生機盎然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的阿戈爾人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1392_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的阿戈爾人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"那座高聳在城市中央的塔不復存在，取而代之的是某種深海溶洞裡才能見到的巨型“石柱”。\n綿密而多孔的海嗣組織，濕滑而細膩的海嗣組織，層層疊疊地包裹住了信標塔的外牆。\n但仍有照明設備的燈光從深處透出，將周圍的一切暈染得詭異又綺麗。\n石柱上的菌落簌簌飄落，在廣場上展開成造型奇特的生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的阿戈爾人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1392_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是那幾尊雕塑還能看出個大概，我甚至想不到眼前的一切與文明有何關聯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的阿戈爾人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……“巢穴化”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的阿戈爾人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1392_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城市裡怎麼會出現海嗣？我們明明都還沒有……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的阿戈爾人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要結果符合預期，過程是不是由我們親手推動，都無所謂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的阿戈爾人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但願這對於正在沉淪的阿戈爾人來說，會是無法忘記的一課。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的阿戈爾人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1392_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的阿戈爾人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"擴大現有的結果，阻止這座城市進行反擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謀害圖利婭還不夠，你們還要從內部徹底破壞城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我本來還指望再觀察一會，順著你們將其他人一網打盡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事態緊急，收網。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們將是海巡隊本月內處理的第三十三、三十四個深海教徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的阿戈爾人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1392_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海巡隊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的阿戈爾人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這段時間，你已經傷害了我們太多手足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的阿戈爾人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一味地服從既有秩序毫無意義，阿戈爾需要的不是在絕望中苟延殘喘——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"囉嗦。沒時間和你們辯論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"西昆妲指揮官，生物訊號異常密集，在短時間內暴漲了三倍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣似乎已經把那座塔築成了巢穴，它們正在源源不斷地從中生成……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能讓這些海嗣向其他城區擴散！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"附近的民眾已經在自發疏散，你帶領一個小隊引導大家向避難倉撤離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得清空路面上的所有輔助機械，如果被海嗣污染，它們會成為對付我們的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人，結成戰鬥編隊，開啟屏障，將海嗣限制在信標塔周邊的區域！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海巡隊隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1390_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第Ⅳ級武器明明已經啟動，難道說……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g7_consuloffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我在聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"立刻封鎖第Ⅳ級武器，以最快的速度對武器系統進行全面檢查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經回防的所有隊伍立刻在港口樞紐重新集結。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從此刻起，所有作戰單位保持頻道暢通。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"執政官閣下，這和您描述的不太一樣。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我想，這並不在計劃之內吧？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意看實時海圖。就在一個小時前，海嗣的生物訊號整體還趨於穩定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而此刻，大陸架上所有巢穴之間的距離正變得越來越近……不，巢穴本身不會移動，它們只是在無限膨脹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像無數滴濃墨在白紙上暈開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"整片海域都在巢穴化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"點狀的巢穴正在連綴成一個整體，而彌利亞留姆，此刻正處於它們的正中間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執政官閣下，阿戈爾投向巢穴的，究竟是驅離海嗣的武器，還是巨量的催化劑？你們究竟在消滅它們，還是餵養它們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是布蘭都斯篡改了信標與武器的聯動關係，那麼一定也是他的動作扭曲了第Ⅳ級武器的生效方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就結果而言……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿戈爾接觸陸地的機會被反向利用了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"城市正在變成海嗣向陸地蔓延的據點。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為航道計劃的總戰爭設計師，我會對正在發生的事情負責。但此時此刻，我們還沒有輸掉這場戰役。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看外面，街道上幾乎聽不見騷亂的動靜，彌利亞留姆並未陷入恐慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在和海嗣糾纏的兩百多年間，我們經歷過無數次類似的變故。宣布彌利亞留姆失守，還為時尚早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，博士，現在離開這裡，我會保護你們前往港口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為執政官會留守在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此時此刻，港口樞紐才是這座城市的心臟，是最不能丟失的陣地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣已經侵入我的城市，我難道要等待這些不速之客敲響這冥思間的門？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g3_beaconctrlroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空氣越來越潮濕了，我、我覺得快要喘不上氣來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"注意腳下。用你身上的裝置浮起來，不要踩到它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……溟痕？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溟痕，海嗣的又一種擴張手段。它們已經從塔頂蔓延到了這裡，鋪開的速度要比陸地上你曾見過的快很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣正在城市裡築巢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在我們頭頂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說有人為海嗣指路……為什麼？怎麼做到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布蘭都斯，那個已經死去的人……這就是他五年心血換來的成果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在他可笑的構想裡，這座塔發出的訊號，以及彌利亞留姆原本用來驅除海嗣的武器，都會成為溝通海嗣與人類的橋梁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他確實搭建起了某種“橋梁”，只不過海嗣並沒有回應他的善意和宏願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所謂的溝通只是幫這群畜生鎖定了彌利亞留姆的位置，理解了它的防禦機制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍團費盡心思將這片海域切割成一個個可控的區域，但就在剛剛，所有被分隔的海嗣巢穴順著信標的訊號，重新結為一體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本應摧毀巢穴、驅除海嗣的第Ⅳ級武器，也發揮了反作用。海嗣的血肉沿著武器打擊的路徑蔓延，本應凋亡的得到了滋養。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，他至死都沒有意識到自己有多傲慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏爾比安閣下，我不太聽得懂您在說什麼。但眼下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座塔已經被海嗣視作新的巢穴，它會源源不斷地吐出幼體，也會吸引其他巢穴的海嗣向此處聚集。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能阻止這種變化嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們唯一還來得及做的，是將信標塔所在的城市單元切割出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……切割？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可水下城市又不是積木搭起來的，要怎麼做才能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對阿戈爾的了解還是太少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和那些由笨重地塊拼起來的陸上移動城市不同，阿戈爾的科技更注重生物性，這一點在城市建設上體現得尤為明顯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對一隻受傷的海獸來說，咬斷自己中毒的肢體，只是本能的反應，而且不算什麼難事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須保住這座城市的剩餘部分，它還有用。否則，當整片海域的海嗣都連成狂潮，再沒有什麼能夠阻擋它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣會毫無阻攔地衝上陸地，衝進……伊比利亞……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏爾比安閣下，具體該怎麼做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龐大而精密的骨架支撐著彌利亞留姆的各個城市單元。控制信標塔所在單元的聯動裝置操作系統，應該就在這個中控室裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啟用它，讓整座信標塔沉入海底。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g3_beaconctrlroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是這個嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能操作——但為什麼沒有任何反應？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來操作系統沒有問題，那就是聯動裝置本身……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"設施管理所有專人負責城市單元骨架的檢查與維護，它發生故障的機率比深海獵人武器生鏽的機率還要低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偏偏是這個時間，這個地點……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g6_aegirarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"設施管理所的“小幫手”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讀數誤差，第二次報錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"設施管理所的“小幫手”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是否運行故障測試？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿維圖斯先生，需要我幫您嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不用。我只是在觀察這台被人拋下的小幫手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g3_beaconctrlroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他真的知道些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏爾比安先生，或許，我知道應該去找誰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聯繫外面的阿戈爾軍人，他們會接應你離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要一個人留在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年輕人，你仍然對我保持懷疑，很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但必須有人留在中控室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦信標塔完全變成巢穴，哪怕我們修好了聯動裝置，彌利亞留姆也無法切割掉這裡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海獸無法吐出那顆不再屬於它的心臟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須守在這裡，親眼確認城市單元骨架恢復運作，親手將信標塔切割出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是這樣的話……您會和信標塔一起沉入海底，您會被無窮無盡的海嗣包圍，直到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不需要你來擔心。還是說，你覺得自己比我更適合做這件事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的時間不多了，年輕人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您怎麼已經……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信標塔的頻道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海巡隊，西昆妲。誰在信標塔內？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g2_beaconsquare_nest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那布蘭都斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已經死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我與他一直保持著往來，卻沒能及時發現異樣，事後我應該向執政官領受責罰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"彌利亞留姆需要丟棄這座塔，而我必須親眼看著它沉入海底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是否還會，又是否還能回到阿戈爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要提無效的問題，西昆妲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不應該因為過往而優柔寡斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……烏爾比安，你想多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布蘭都斯跟我說了當年的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管駁回我申請的人是你，還是布蘭都斯，對我來說都沒有區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我應該承認……沒能成為深海獵人，沒能和你們並肩作戰，對我而言——非常遺憾，非常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我承認當時我有過很長時間的憤怒與不滿……我甚至有些嫉妒斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但後來，我習慣了為你們巡航，為一切守護我們家園和文明的計劃巡航。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"置身於任何一項具體的計劃之外，會讓你看到更多的犧牲，更多的背叛，更多值得懷疑的人，更多脫離軌道的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像現在的你一樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想好你該背負的了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你確實背叛了阿戈爾，真的與那群渣滓為伍，那麼你此刻留在信標塔即是為了逃離，我會承擔放走一位墮落者的罪責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你仍是深海獵人，你將孤身戰鬥……但潛入城市、進入信標塔，加上評議會的結果，你的嫌疑已經很難洗清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾或許不會銘記你的犧牲……就像圖利婭注定會被遺忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但此時切割信標塔，確實能在最大程度上幫助彌利亞留姆應對災變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認同你的選擇，我會給予你最低程度的信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五分鐘。五分鐘後我會接應那個陸地人離開信標塔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g10_shipinterior"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全城已經啟動緊急交通協調方案，我們接下來會從鬥智場駛入中軸通道，前往港口樞紐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會留在港口樞紐指揮作戰，海巡隊會接管這艘艦船，護送你們盡快返回陸地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人機矩陣也將前往那座燈塔，協助伊比利亞完成布防。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彌利亞留姆是否也應該組織城內的民眾撤離？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彌利亞留姆是一座軍事堡壘，它具備在戰時安置民眾的能力。與戰鬥無關的民眾已經在海巡隊的護送下前往避難倉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"執政官閣下，您手邊的那些神經纜線……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不應該以這種扭曲的方式抽搐吧？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不應該。通訊失靈了，我與艦船操作系統的連接也被切斷了……我正在失去對艦船的控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小幫手，立刻運行全艦檢測程序。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小幫手”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"系統被入侵的程度比我剛剛預想的還要嚴重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位，非常抱歉，我們可能來不及降落了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彌利亞留姆城內的人工重力環境還沒有失效，你們身上的裝置可以幫助你們在空中自由游動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟著我，不必害怕，從艙門走出去就可以。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g6_aegirarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊依然沒有恢復，整個鬥智場似乎被誰以某種手段與外界隔絕了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——Mon3tr！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（警惕的嘯叫）"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mon3tr張開漆黑的利爪，灼熱感撲面而來。執政官也幾乎同時做出了反應，她拔出儀仗劍，側身擋在你與凱爾希的身前。\n你們同時留意到了前方的“敵人”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g6_aegirarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"narration","text":"一隻形貌特殊的海嗣懸在你們面前。\n它似乎沒有敵意，在被Mon3tr的叫聲驚動之前，它只是安靜地懸在那裡，鬥智場中央的珊瑚狀終端照亮它沒有五官的臉。\n環繞在海嗣身體周圍的粒狀細胞器如同手臂般展開，“摩挲”著枝葉，與上面那些流動的文字與符號融為一體。\n它在觀察？它在感受？它能理解那些屬於人類的感性和理性嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"它轉向了你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一隻……海嗣。是它入侵了鬥智場的終端？前所未見的能力，這不是什麼好現象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（模糊的阿戈爾語）此處並無正義，唯有前路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一隻海嗣侵入阿戈爾的城市，在先哲設計的聖地念誦古老的箴言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我參與這場戰爭以來，見過的最為諷刺的畫面、最為無禮的挑釁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它對語言的運用，說話的方式和習慣……並非海嗣強行“學習”的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執政官閣下，這隻海嗣恐怕曾是人類。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"語言。我從未將它遺忘，而它也不曾棄我而去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼你的思想呢？你拙劣地模仿先哲的話語時，是否理解自己所念誦的言辭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"理解？不。留下這句話的時候，我並不理解它真正的含義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，我重新認知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留下這句話……瑪利圖斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊門莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地幔遺跡第四考察隊的核心成員，兩百多年前意外失蹤的人類學家暨先史文明研究者，瑪利圖斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……十分遙遠的回憶，我確實，曾被如此稱呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如今，你只需理解現象本身。你們面前是一隻海嗣。你們只需要如此稱呼我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“海嗣”。"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣飄向了你們。\n透過它透明的顱腔，你看見色澤詭異的核狀物聚攏又散開，穩定地變化著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾人，現在，讓我和你身後的人談談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（憤怒的吼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——讓這個小東西收起獠牙吧，它的火焰無法燒灼我的血液。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"AMa-10——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你是誰？你為什麼這麼稱呼凱爾希？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你知道凱爾希的身分？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，保持警惕。我來與它對話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Kal-tsit……凱爾希。原來如此。如果你更習慣被稱作凱爾希，那我也可以如此稱呼你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，我等待你，你們，很長時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
